otes":["Git LFS works again when you start Northspline from Finder or the Dock. Git could not find `git-lfs` there, so refreshing a repository failed.","Every diff has a Create patch button. It writes what you see: the commit or comparison in History, only the open file when you opened one, or the changes of the file in Changes.","You can return from one file to the diff of all files: choose All changes at the top of the file list, or the back arrow in front of the file name.","Context menus are grouped and have icons. With several commits or files selected, the menu says which entries act on the selection and which on the one you clicked."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.16-17","version":"0.1.0-beta.16"}],"schema_version":1,"trust":{"checksum":"sha256","manifest_signature":"Ed25519 detached signature over exact JSON bytes","signature_encoding":"base64"}}
